(4291242, 618964, 80859, '<td valign="top">i think i see what you''re getting at.  people don''t see the handlers because they are focused on the balloon thing.  however, i''m drawn to the same in the photo and would still not really notice them except for your title telling me to. if there had been some way that you could have made the handlers more the central focus of the shot and still see the object being handled....<br/> what a freaky float, btw!</td>', 'i think i see what you''re getting at.  people don''t see the handlers because they are focused on the balloon thing.  however, i''m drawn to the same in the photo and would still not really notice them except for your title telling me to. if there had been some way that you could have made the handlers more the central focus of the shot and still see the object being handled.... what a freaky float, btw!', '2007-12-05 09:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
