(4302344, 619818, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great idea - chair is blurry. Maybe a chair without casters would stay still better.</td>', 'Great idea - chair is blurry. Maybe a chair without casters would stay still better.', '2007-12-08 22:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302348, 619735, 77196, '<td valign="top">This might be even better with a tigher crop - maybe of just the umbrella and wet street.</td>', 'This might be even better with a tigher crop - maybe of just the umbrella and wet street.', '2007-12-08 22:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302414, 618905, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so cute I can hardly stand it.   What a great idea for this challenge.   The thumb does not do it justice, so when it popped up on my screen, it melted my heart :)</td>', 'Oh this is so cute I can hardly stand it.   What a great idea for this challenge.   The thumb does not do it justice, so when it popped up on my screen, it melted my heart :)', '2007-12-08 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302417, 619924, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh. . .I <i>like</i> it!  The haunting eerie feel makes it very appealing.</td>', 'Oooooh. . .I like it!  The haunting eerie feel makes it very appealing.', '2007-12-08 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302422, 619491, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh what a great idea for this challenge.  I love these ghosty photos.  And this one is so good.  One of my favorites, and definitely one of my highest scores.  9  (only because it could be a tiny bit lighter showing a little more detail in the front rocks. . .but still amazing and awesome!)</td>', 'Oh what a great idea for this challenge.  I love these ghosty photos.  And this one is so good.  One of my favorites, and definitely one of my highest scores.  9  (only because it could be a tiny bit lighter showing a little more detail in the front rocks. . .but still amazing and awesome!)', '2007-12-08 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302426, 619818, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love these types of photos.  I''ve always wanted to try one, but haven''t yet, so I''m always impressed when someone pulls it off so well.   Good job, and a great idea for this challenge.</td>', 'I love these types of photos.  I''ve always wanted to try one, but haven''t yet, so I''m always impressed when someone pulls it off so well.   Good job, and a great idea for this challenge.', '2007-12-08 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302428, 617773, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   THIS is a STUNNING photo.  The wow factor is huge!  10</td>', 'Wow!   THIS is a STUNNING photo.  The wow factor is huge!  10', '2007-12-08 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302433, 619735, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love urban photos.   This is so interesting.   I wish I was a fly on the wall watching you set this up and shoot it. . .or maybe it wasn''t set up, and you just stumbled upon this interesting scene.   I really like it!</td>', 'I love urban photos.   This is so interesting.   I wish I was a fly on the wall watching you set this up and shoot it. . .or maybe it wasn''t set up, and you just stumbled upon this interesting scene.   I really like it!', '2007-12-08 23:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302438, 619660, 43088, '<td valign="top">Had to think for a moment on this. Tropical is not seen in the artic neither is the artic seen in the tropics. OK.</td>', 'Had to think for a moment on this. Tropical is not seen in the artic neither is the artic seen in the tropics. OK.', '2007-12-08 23:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302441, 619894, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwww. . . .that face makes my heart melt.  I just want to reach over and get some puppy kisses  :)</td>', 'Awwwwwwww. . . .that face makes my heart melt.  I just want to reach over and get some puppy kisses  :)', '2007-12-08 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302443, 619649, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a dramatic awesome photo!  The lighting is exquisite, and it is a wonderful photo for this challenge.  The connection is strong.  Surely this one will be in the very top few!   I''ll do my part.  10  :)</td>', 'Wow!  What a dramatic awesome photo!  The lighting is exquisite, and it is a wonderful photo for this challenge.  The connection is strong.  Surely this one will be in the very top few!   I''ll do my part.  10  :)', '2007-12-08 23:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302445, 619167, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww. . . .she makes my heart hurt (in a good way)</td>', 'Awwwwwww. . . .she makes my heart hurt (in a good way)', '2007-12-08 23:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302448, 619385, 43088, '<td valign="top">A rice crispies volcano.</td>', 'A rice crispies volcano.', '2007-12-08 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302449, 619667, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh man. . .what a great photojournalistic photo.  I can literally feel her aches and pain.   Sooooo did she finish?    I hope so.   I do like the concept for this challenge too.</td>', 'Oh man. . .what a great photojournalistic photo.  I can literally feel her aches and pain.   Sooooo did she finish?    I hope so.   I do like the concept for this challenge too.', '2007-12-08 23:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302450, 618289, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really good.   I love its simplicity.  Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'This is really good.   I love its simplicity.  Perfect for the challenge.', '2007-12-08 23:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302453, 619896, 43088, '<td valign="top">And the seldom seen photographer as he takes the photo.</td>', 'And the seldom seen photographer as he takes the photo.', '2007-12-08 23:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302454, 619280, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.   I really like the idea of these ghostly images for this challenge.  It fits perfectly, and you did a great job on this one.</td>', 'Very nicely done.   I really like the idea of these ghostly images for this challenge.  It fits perfectly, and you did a great job on this one.', '2007-12-08 23:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4302455, 618596, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an amazing wildlife capture.  Congratulations!  I LOVE it!</td>', 'What an amazing wildlife capture.  Congratulations!  I LOVE it!', '2007-12-08 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
