(4302472, 617931, 43088, '<td valign="top">Is that the bottom of a desk? Needs cleaned up! I like the shot. Created or found?</td>', 'Is that the bottom of a desk? Needs cleaned up! I like the shot. Created or found?', '2007-12-08 23:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
