(4302482, 619831, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this.   It''s strong, and reminds me of something very contemporary, like you might see it in an art gallery or hanging on the wall in some ultra modern decor for a splash of the unexpected.</td>', 'I love this.   It''s strong, and reminds me of something very contemporary, like you might see it in an art gallery or hanging on the wall in some ultra modern decor for a splash of the unexpected.', '2007-12-08 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
