(4302485, 618818, 24454, '<td valign="top">How cool is that!  He is definitely seeing something isn''t he.  I love it!</td>', 'How cool is that!  He is definitely seeing something isn''t he.  I love it!', '2007-12-08 23:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
