(4309386, 619638, 73884, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dwainasaurus:</b></div><hr/><i> Strobist says ''get the flash off the camera''. Probably kinda tough under water. I like the subject and color, but background could have used more light. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Without the flash you won''t see any reds or yellows at this depth. Also, because is water, you cannot lighten up the background - you have to use whaterver ambient light is there.</td>', 'Originally posted by dwainasaurus: Strobist says ''get the flash off the camera''. Probably kinda tough under water. I like the subject and color, but background could have used more light.   Without the flash you won''t see any reds or yellows at this depth. Also, because is water, you cannot lighten up the background - you have to use whaterver ambient light is there.', '2007-12-12 00:11:19.000000', NULL, 0),
