(4329674, 619688, 88010, '<td valign="top">Thats an awesome drop shot. I did a few of these last year, very fun. None of mine turned out this nice. Mine all seemed to have one drop coming back up. So how did you get this nice "flowered" splash?</td>', 'Thats an awesome drop shot. I did a few of these last year, very fun. None of mine turned out this nice. Mine all seemed to have one drop coming back up. So how did you get this nice "flowered" splash?', '2007-12-22 09:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
